Note on data provenance (does not affect the licence of the code above):
`ssmula_landscape.py` is original code written for this project. The fitness tables it loads from
`data/ssmula/*.csv` are processed data from SSMuLA (Li et al., Cell Systems 2025; Zenodo
doi:10.5281/zenodo.13910506), whose own code is licensed GPL-3.0. No SSMuLA code is included in or derived
from this repository — only their published data tables are read, by our own independently-written loader.
Redistributors of the data tables themselves should refer to SSMuLA's own licence and citation terms.
